# 统一换行符：仓库内文本一律 LF，二进制保持原样。
# 不设这条时 Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会把 .sh/.lua 检出成 CRLF，
# 拷到路由器会报 "not found" / 解析错。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.lua text eol=lf
*.htm text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ipk binary
*.apk binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pptx binary
